WEBVTT

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:08.890
Taito, I'm here.

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:12.070
Ha-Haruka...?

00:02:19.910 --> 00:02:21.290
It's impossible.

00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:24.620
We don't have enough power to 
break through this barrier.

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:32.940
What's the meaning of this?

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:34.960
Why did you bring an outsider here?

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:36.530
Th-That's because...

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:38.590
I told her to do it.

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:41.630
I believe that everybody 
is sick of curry by now.

00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:47.310
So I asked the talented 
Shigure-san to cook for us.

00:02:47.890 --> 00:02:52.450
Ridiculous! You brought an outsider 
here for such a petty reason?!

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:56.030
We need to feed everyone properly if 
we're going to keep them motivated.

00:02:56.030 --> 00:03:00.140
Weren't you griping 
about Izumi-san's curry?

00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:03.670
What? I've been working really hard.

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:05.900
I love curry.

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:08.290
Thank you, Mirai-chan!

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:10.870
That's not the issue here!

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:14.840
Am I not welcome here?

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:19.200
I just wanted to help everybody...

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:22.050
Should I leave?

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:24.040
No, that's not it.

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:26.100
We're just surprised. That's all.

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:29.130
Why did you have to bring Haruka here?

00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:31.840
She doesn't know anything 
about what's going on!

00:03:31.840 --> 00:03:33.550
If something happens to her...

00:03:33.550 --> 00:03:37.690
You just have to protect her then.

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:48.020
What are you up to?

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:49.740
You never stop.

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:53.750
I only brought her here to cook for us.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:55.050
There's no other reason.

00:03:55.050 --> 00:03:56.390
And you expect me to believe that?

00:03:56.670 --> 00:04:01.290
Well, I suppose I chose her because 
I thought it would be amusing.

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:01.970
What?

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:07.300
The chaos that results from a 
heartbreaking love triangle.

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:11.440
An absolute must for 
summertime recreation.

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:13.570
I love to watch adolescent drama.

00:04:13.570 --> 00:04:17.900
You dragged Shigure Haruka here 
to provide entertainment?!

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:23.760
Hold on. A leader shouldn't 
lose his cool so easily.

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:27.380
That's right.

00:04:27.380 --> 00:04:30.610
You need to learn to 
control your emotions.

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:32.840
You bastard...

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:34.340
Still...

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:39.790
Technically, she isn't an outsider.

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:47.950
Who is it?

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:53.830
Guess what, Gekkou?

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:58.740
Izumi-chan just taught me that this is 
how we're supposed to play on the beach.

00:04:58.740 --> 00:05:01.650
Now, now, Gekkou-kun. 
You're supposed to go,

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:05.450
"You little rascal!" in response.

00:05:11.490 --> 00:05:13.090
You little rascal!

00:05:13.090 --> 00:05:16.720
Wait! Get on your knees so I 
can smack you hard, you scum!

00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:19.150
What are they doing?

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:23.220
Taito, is it okay for me to 
use what I find around here?

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:26.020
It's okay, really.

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:28.960
You don't have to cook for us.

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:30.970
But that's why I'm here.

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:35.390
I'm ready to do whatever 
I can to help you guys.

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:41.360
Then I'll give you a hand.

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:44.830
What? It's okay. You 
should get some rest.

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:47.160
I can't do that.

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:50.380
Uh... What should I do?

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:52.740
In that case, peel the onions for me.

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:53.540
Got it.

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:02.200
Wow, you're good!

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:05.230
This is normal.

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:12.050
Huh? Where's Himea?

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:19.230
Whoa! What are you doing?!

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:22.580
I-I've never done this before...

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:26.280
Wh-What do we do?!

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:28.530
W-Water! Water!

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:42.660
Stupid Taito...

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:46.510
Huh? You're by yourself, Himea-san?

00:06:46.890 --> 00:06:52.960
Man... That student council president 
doesn't know how to take a joke.

00:06:55.510 --> 00:06:56.240
Hmm?

00:07:00.470 --> 00:07:01.520
No thanks.

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:03.060
Oh, really?

00:07:05.410 --> 00:07:09.190
Yeah, this is fun. I love the beach.

00:07:09.190 --> 00:07:10.720
What about you, Himea-san?

00:07:12.770 --> 00:07:14.250
I hate the beach...

00:07:25.890 --> 00:07:29.120
It reminds me of the past...

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:44.170
Kurogane-kun is pretty cruel.

00:07:44.170 --> 00:07:47.660
How can he leave this 
cute girl all by herself?

00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:50.210
Don't badmouth Taito.

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:52.740
Oh. Sorry.

00:08:07.060 --> 00:08:12.130
Taito belongs on that side.

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:17.410
If I never got him involved, 
he would still be...

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:24.560
So you feel bad for Shigure-san.

00:08:25.790 --> 00:08:30.910
Forget that. Why don't you 
just go glomp him like always?

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:40.950
Aha. You're pretty cute.

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:41.900
Hey!

00:08:41.900 --> 00:08:45.840
Considering how you've lived like 
forever and you're super strong.

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:47.820
Man, you're too cute!

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:49.340
Stop it!

00:08:49.340 --> 00:08:52.700
That's love for you. Yep, 
I'm a little jealous.

00:08:52.700 --> 00:08:55.090
You're so adorable.

00:08:55.090 --> 00:09:00.640
Okay, I haves to help you outs here.

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:06.390
A test of courage?

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:11.650
It's the typical nighttime 
recreational event.

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:14.800
I refuse. Are we in grade school?

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:16.810
This is why I can't stand scum.

00:09:16.810 --> 00:09:18.870
I like it. Let's do that.

00:09:18.870 --> 00:09:19.870
You bastard!

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:23.520
It's a good idea for the student 
council members to fraternize.

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:27.530
One of the goals of this 
camp is to build trust.

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:30.340
Ridiculous. There are better ways to...

00:09:30.340 --> 00:09:32.880
Hey, hey. What's a test of courage?

00:09:32.880 --> 00:09:35.050
A test of courage is where

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:38.680
you run around places that 
are haunted by ghosts.

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:41.800
Gh-Ghosts?! I can't stand ghosts!

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:44.850
But it's a lot of fun.

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:46.890
I-It's fun?

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:50.100
Yep! Full of exciting 
thrills and nervous chills.

00:09:50.100 --> 00:09:51.890
Your heart goes all aflutter!

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:54.760
Really? Is it more exciting 
than Bun-chan-man?

00:09:54.760 --> 00:09:56.930
Bun-chan-man can't 
hold a candle to this!

00:09:56.930 --> 00:09:59.990
Wow! Count me in! Let's 
do a test of courage!

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:01.680
You slaves can shut up!

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:02.900
I absolutely refuse to...

00:10:02.900 --> 00:10:04.730
That settles it.

00:10:04.730 --> 00:10:07.720
Suzae-san, please set everything up.

00:10:07.720 --> 00:10:09.010
Y-Yes, sir.

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:14.060
A test of courage, huh...

00:10:14.060 --> 00:10:16.780
We had one during the school camp.

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:18.960
Yeah, now that you mention it.

00:10:18.960 --> 00:10:21.970
There was a huge fuss because 
the girls started crying.

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:25.470
That's right. But I didn't cry.

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:27.180
Really?

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:28.920
Really.

00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:31.740
I'm not a crybaby.

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:41.910
You're supposed to pair 
up in a test of courage.

00:10:42.180 --> 00:10:46.580
We're supposed to draw straws to 
pick our partners, but I fixed it for you.

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:47.590
Then...

00:10:47.590 --> 00:10:49.420
You'll be alone with Kurogane-kun.

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:52.130
When you get to a spot 
that looks really haunted,

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:53.540
scream as loud as you can.

00:10:53.850 --> 00:10:55.920
But I'm not scared of ghosts.

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:58.860
Just pretend to be scared.

00:10:58.860 --> 00:11:01.370
Put your acting skills to work.

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:03.230
A-Acting skills?

00:11:03.230 --> 00:11:06.190
"I'm so scared, Taito. Help."

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:08.430
And then you throw yourself on him.

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:11.190
You can even throw in a kiss or two.

00:11:14.370 --> 00:11:18.070
I enjoy the bittersweet 
taste of adolescence.

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:23.370
But you don't want to forget 
to add a spicy kick.

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:39.840
You'll be alone with Kurogane-kun.

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:42.380
When you get to a spot 
that looks really haunted,

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:44.210
scream as loud as you can.

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:45.760
Himea.

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:48.180
Wh-What is it?

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:51.420
Sorry about earlier.

00:11:52.070 --> 00:11:54.100
How I left you alone all day.

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:56.800
It's okay. I don't mind.

00:11:56.800 --> 00:11:58.140
O-Oh.

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:02.690
Ah, I saw that you and 
Izumi have gotten close.

00:12:02.690 --> 00:12:04.170
What were you talking about?

00:12:04.170 --> 00:12:06.810
N-Nothing important...

00:12:08.220 --> 00:12:10.550
O-Oh...

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:20.820
Izumi-chan! We're starting!

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:21.990
Okay!

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:27.570
Everyone take a piece of paper.

00:12:27.570 --> 00:12:29.930
I can't wait to see 
who's paired with who.

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:32.150
Now open your paper.

00:12:35.890 --> 00:12:37.440
N-Number one...

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:38.610
Who's number three?

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:44.030
That would be me. Let's enjoy 
ourselves, Kurogane-kun.

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:46.730
What? Seriously?

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:52.890
It won't be that easy.

00:12:52.890 --> 00:12:55.580
Obstacles add spice to adolescence.

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:59.090
Kurosu-san, that's not very mature.

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:00.840
We'll go in order then.

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:02.750
Gekkou-kun and Mirai-san go first.

00:13:02.750 --> 00:13:04.660
Then it's Himea-san and Aomi-san.

00:13:04.660 --> 00:13:07.020
Followed by Shigure-san and Suzae-san.

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:09.890
Kurogane-kun and I will go last.

00:13:09.890 --> 00:13:12.950
Yeah... This is weak.

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:18.330
Oh? You wanted to be 
paired up with a girl?

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:20.210
Let's get started.

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:23.690
I want to be finished 
with this worthless game.

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:26.010
Hey! Wait up, Gekkou!

00:13:26.010 --> 00:13:30.770
Okay, then. Time to start the 
super fun test of courage!

00:13:37.220 --> 00:13:39.840
G-G-Gekkou...

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:43.820
A-Are there any ghosts around? 
Do they really exist?

00:13:43.820 --> 00:13:45.860
A demon shouldn't be scared of ghosts.

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:47.880
And get off me. It's hard to walk.

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:50.790
B-B-But...

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:55.030
There it is!

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:56.900
Hey, wait!

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:08.020
G-Gekkou...

00:14:14.230 --> 00:14:17.450
Th-This isn't scary at all.

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:21.190
We're just walking 
through a dark forest.

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:25.670
Yes! There's no reason to be scared.

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:33.490
Sounds like they're having a blast.

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:40.680
Sorry to disappoint you.

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:44.320
It's weird though. I fixed 
it so you'd be paired up.

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:46.750
It doesn't matter now.

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:50.480
You're a strange person.

00:14:51.270 --> 00:14:54.110
Why are you helping me?

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:59.430
Humans will never do anything 
that doesn't benefit them.

00:14:59.430 --> 00:15:02.820
Ouch. But Kurogane-kun's also human.

00:15:03.550 --> 00:15:05.270
Taito's special.

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:07.140
I see.

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:10.350
Well, you're probably right.

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:15.190
I'm only here because 
I want to have fun.

00:15:15.190 --> 00:15:16.530
Fun?

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:18.790
Yep, I'm having fun.

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:22.450
Between joining the student council, 
participating in this camp,

00:15:22.950 --> 00:15:26.480
and this weird training, 
I'm having a blast.

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:29.640
Aren't you an ordinary human?

00:15:30.010 --> 00:15:33.110
You aren't immortal like Taito is.

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:35.510
Aren't you scared of dying?

00:15:38.240 --> 00:15:40.740
Everybody dies eventually.

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:44.710
It's just a matter of how soon.

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:47.360
In the end, we're all dead.

00:15:48.740 --> 00:15:50.900
Are you having fun?

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:52.590
Me?

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:54.720
Mr. Kurosu told me.

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:59.340
Vampires are really strong 
and live really long.

00:15:59.340 --> 00:16:01.930
So you aren't going to die so easily.

00:16:01.930 --> 00:16:05.570
But I have to wonder if that's any fun.

00:16:12.310 --> 00:16:17.450
You see, I want to have fun because 
I know I have a time limit.

00:16:21.370 --> 00:16:22.940
So Hime-chan,

00:16:23.230 --> 00:16:24.460
let's have fun.

00:16:28.820 --> 00:16:32.770
Well, I'm certainly 
enjoying the atmosphere.

00:16:32.770 --> 00:16:34.320
Yeah.

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:38.370
Kurogane-kun, you can hold 
my hand if you're scared.

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:40.550
U-Uh, I'll pass.

00:16:40.550 --> 00:16:41.720
Oh?

00:16:42.870 --> 00:16:46.240
I guess you would have preferred 
to be with Himea-san?

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:48.310
Or perhaps Shigure Haruka-san?

00:16:49.470 --> 00:16:52.450
I'm so jealous of how you're 
surrounded by girls.

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:54.540
You should share.

00:16:54.540 --> 00:16:57.240
Is that something a 
teacher should be saying?

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:02.550
But Himea-san is special.

00:17:03.010 --> 00:17:09.080
We wouldn't want you to make her sad 
and get the world destroyed in the process.

00:17:10.150 --> 00:17:12.450
The military knows everything.

00:17:12.450 --> 00:17:16.990
Including the fact that the Rapture 
spell was activated in Miyasaka High School.

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:23.640
Ramiel Lilith, the ancient witch...

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:26.350
Once her loneliness drove her insane,

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:29.460
she tried to use the Rapture 
spell to end the world.

00:17:29.850 --> 00:17:32.070
So the prophecy ordains.

00:17:32.550 --> 00:17:33.440
Prophecy?

00:17:33.440 --> 00:17:37.110
The military and I, the 
other magic societies,

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:41.120
the brothers Gekkou-kun and Hinata-kun, 
and the otherworldly Seraphim

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:44.290
are all moving according to prophecy.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:52.110
We want you to like Himea-san.

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:55.670
I don't need you to tell me that!

00:17:57.640 --> 00:18:01.240
That answer earns you 100 
points, Kurogane-kun.

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:04.910
Did you see any ghosts?

00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:10.590
I appreciate it, Kurogane-kun.

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:19.910
What's wrong?

00:18:21.220 --> 00:18:22.830
Feeling dizzy?

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:40.600
Taito...

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:59.200
Go! Zap away!

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:06.240
Exorcise: Spell Error!

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:14.160
We did it!

00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:17.140
Hooray! Hooray! Yahoo!

00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:20.700
Our friendship triumphs in the end!

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:22.890
You didn't do anything!

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:25.600
What? I was cheering for you and stuff.

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:28.570
We did it! We beat it!

00:19:29.590 --> 00:19:31.380
S-Sorry, I wasn't thinking...

00:19:32.990 --> 00:19:34.850
Taito!

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:47.370
Another uneventful summer...

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:53.590
You shouldn't do that, Mr. Kurosu.

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:56.780
Delicious.

00:19:56.780 --> 00:19:59.340
I'm sure that you'll 
make a wonderful wife.

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:01.480
P-Please...

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:06.480
Are you working hard for the 
sake of the person you like?

00:20:06.860 --> 00:20:08.990
Huh?! N-No, I'm just...

00:20:08.990 --> 00:20:13.480
I'm sure that the person 
you like is very happy.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:16.110
D-Do you think so?

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:18.240
Yes, I'm positive.

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:24.820
Festival

00:20:31.350 --> 00:20:34.000
Can't forget about these 
when you're at the beach.

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:36.000
Lemme try! Lemme try!

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:39.250
Hmph. Honestly, worthless trash.

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:43.480
Gekkou! Gekkou! This is crazy!

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:46.760
Idiot! Don't point them at me!

00:20:51.640 --> 00:20:53.520
Damn you trash!

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:55.090
I'm executing every last one of you!

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:05.560
It's beautiful...

00:21:06.520 --> 00:21:08.460
Good work, Haruka.

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:10.200
Thanks for cooking.

00:21:11.590 --> 00:21:15.210
If you're happy, then I'm glad I came.

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:17.520
Look at it go!

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:26.970
Go on. Ask him to join you.

00:21:28.410 --> 00:21:29.430
But...

00:21:42.470 --> 00:21:44.430
Oh, it's too bad.

00:21:44.430 --> 00:21:45.790
Keep at it, Haruka.

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:47.420
Uh-huh...

00:21:53.460 --> 00:21:54.500
Taito...

00:21:55.070 --> 00:21:56.620
